  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "**Features**\n- **Measured font fallback (`RaTeX.Avalonia`)**: new `FormulaLayout.ParseAndLayoutAsync` / `MeasureFallbackGlyphs` lay out CJK, emoji, and other fallback characters using the real Avalonia font metrics. Use it instead of `Ratex.ParseAndLayout` when positions must match the drawn font.\n- **Host metrics API (`RaTeX`)**: `FallbackGlyphMetrics`, `Ratex.ParseAndLayoutWithFallbackMetrics`, `Ratex.TryParseAndLayoutWithFallbackMetrics`.\n\n**Build, packaging & docs**\n- Repo layout renamed `RaTeX.Net` → `RaTeX`\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Sylinko/RaTeX.Net/compare/v1.0.0-alpha.1...v1.0.0-alpha.2",
